cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Digital Collections Explorer in research, please cite the paper below and the release you used.
type: software
title: Digital Collections Explorer
abstract: >-
  The open-source, multimodal viewer for searching digital collections, with or without a catalog.
  A gallery, library, archive, or museum points it at a folder, an S3 bucket, or a
  manifest of images and their catalog, and visitors search the collection in plain
  language or with a picture.
